    "body": "<div>\n            \n  <div class=\"section\">\n\n<p>Common markup in admin templates.</p>\n<div class=\"section\">\n<h2>Linking to edit pages</h2>\n<p>Dispatches to edit pages is done by <code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">admin_edit_rsc</span></code>.</p>\n<p>Linking:</p>\n<div class=\"highlight-django notranslate\"><div class=\"highlight\"><pre><span></span><span class=\"cp\">{%</span> <span class=\"k\">url</span> <span class=\"nv\">admin_edit_rsc</span> <span class=\"nv\">id</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"nv\">my_id</span> <span class=\"cp\">%}</span><span class=\"x\"></span>\n</pre></div>\n</div>\n<p>Redirecting:</p>\n<div class=\"highlight-django notranslate\"><div class=\"highlight\"><pre><span></span><span class=\"cp\">{%</span> <span class=\"k\">button</span> <span class=\"nv\">text</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;edit&quot;</span> <span class=\"nv\">action</span><span class=\"o\">={</span><span class=\"nv\">redirect</span> <span class=\"nv\">dispatch</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;admin_edit_rsc&quot;</span> <span class=\"nv\">id</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"nv\">my_id</span><span class=\"o\">}</span> <span class=\"cp\">%}</span><span class=\"x\"></span>\n</pre></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n           </div>",
